  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Ormai ci siamo con la ricerca speciale!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0072006D006100690020006300690020007300690061006D006F00200063006F006E0020006C0061002000720069006300650072006300610020007300700065006300690061006C0065002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ricerca?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006900630065007200630061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Speciale?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 8,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300700065006300690061006C0065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le Luminopoli dimensionali continuano\nad appari’, no?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650020004C0075006D0069006E006F0070006F006C0069002000640069006D0065006E00730069006F006E0061006C006900200063006F006E00740069006E00750061006E006F000A0061006400200061007000700061007200692019002C0020006E006F003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scommetto che fra queste ci stanno Luminopoli\ndimensionali ancora inesplorate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 8,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>ricerca speciale<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> non è altro che il sistema per\nlocalizza’ queste Luminopoli dimensionali<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nancora da scopri’!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ne parlo come se l’avessi inventata io, ma\nin realtà è stata la Q-asar Inc.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con la ricerca speciale dovremmo poter trova’\ndelle particolari distorsioni che porteranno<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nin queste aree inesplorate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non è ancora completa, tuttavia.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOccorrono dei sopralluoghi dimensionali, perciò\nbuona fortuna con gli incarichi!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Porta a termine gli incarichi dimensionali, così\nla ricerca speciale sarà pronta finalmente!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ottimo lavoro.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007400740069006D006F0020006C00610076006F0072006F002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ha portato brillantemente a termine l’incarico\ndel signor Corvin.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006100200070006F0072007400610074006F0020006200720069006C006C0061006E00740065006D0065006E00740065002000610020007400650072006D0069006E00650020006C20190069006E00630061007200690063006F000A00640065006C0020007300690067006E006F007200200043006F007200760069006E002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le chiedo la cortesia di fargli visita nella sua\nstanza.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065002000630068006900650064006F0020006C006100200063006F00720074006500730069006100200064006900200066006100720067006C006900200076006900730069007400610020006E0065006C006C00610020007300750061000A007300740061006E007A0061002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ben fatto! Ben fatto assai!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420065006E00200066006100740074006F0021002000420065006E00200066006100740074006F002000610073007300610069002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Molto bene, ora inserisco nel sistema tutti i dati\nche hai raccolto...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ed ecco qua! La ricerca speciale è pronta!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500640020006500630063006F002000710075006100210020004C0061002000720069006300650072006300610020007300700065006300690061006C0065002000E8002000700072006F006E00740061002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comunque, si chiama \"ricerca speciale\" perché\nserve a condurre ricerche in delle distorsioni<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndimensionali speciali!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si rivolga pure a me quando desidera attivare\nla ricerca speciale.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020007200690076006F006C0067006100200070007500720065002000610020006D00650020007100750061006E0064006F002000640065007300690064006500720061002000610074007400690076006100720065000A006C0061002000720069006300650072006300610020007300700065006300690061006C0065002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma pensa te! Gran lavoro!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061002000700065006E0073006100200074006500210020004700720061006E0020006C00610076006F0072006F002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ci son ottime probabilità di trova’ Pokémon unici\nnelle Luminopoli dimensionali localizzabili<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncon la ricerca speciale!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma attent<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, per usarla dovrai recupera’ ogni\nvolta nuovi dati.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100200061007400740065006E007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002C002000700065007200200075007300610072006C006100200064006F007600720061006900200072006500630075007000650072006120190020006F0067006E0069000A0076006F006C007400610020006E0075006F0076006900200064006100740069002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo so, è un po’ uno strazio, ma conoscendoti\nson certo che te la caverai!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Per utilizzare la ricerca speciale è necessario\nraccogliere punti sopralluogo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
